.TH CUDDLE 1 "September 2026" "cuddle 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cuddle \- a private, consent-first guide and lo-fi Litmo containment hub
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cuddle
[\fB\-\-soft\fR]
[\fB\-\-hub\fR]
[\fB\-\-tui\fR [\fIflood\fR|\fItouch\fR|\fIsignal\fR]]
[\fB\-\-gui\fR]
[\fB\-\-guide\fR]
[\fB\-\-map\fR]
[\fB\-\-stop\fR]
[\fB\-\-morning\fR]
[\fB\-\-spoon\fR]
[\fB\-\-hold\fR]
[\fB\-\-too\-much\fR]
[\fB\-\-flood\fR]
[\fB\-\-aftercare\fR]
[\fB\-\-parallel\fR]
[\fB\-\-touch\fR]
[\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cuddle
is a small local companion for consent-first connection and a lo-fi
terminal cut of Litmo containment protocols. With no option it prints a
short invitation to presence. It does not network, log, write files, or
retain answers.
.PP
.B q
is Soft Signal in every interactive flow: stop immediately, no
explanation, no penalty. Stopping safely is success.
.PP
The original interactive guide (\fB\-\-guide\fR) offers branches for
identifying needs, asking for affection or support, setting boundaries,
uncertainty, and opting out. The bash hub (\fB\-\-hub\fR) lists protocols
as numbered menus. The TUI (\fB\-\-tui\fR) adds cathedral chrome, a
huge-type flood screen, and a Touch Language body map. \fB\-\-gui\fR
opens a local HTML Soft Signal Stop button.
.PP
Touch Language is a map, never consent to touch. Completing a protocol
does not mean anyone is fixed, healed, or ready.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-soft, \-s
Print the original longer note.
.TP
.B \-\-hub, \-\-cathedral
Open the bash containment hub. Exits with an error when standard input
or output is not a terminal.
.TP
.B \-\-tui [\fIflood\fR|\fItouch\fR|\fIsignal\fR]
Open the curses TUI. Default screen is the hub. Requires python3.
.B q
is Soft Signal. Touch Language is never consent.
.TP
.B \-\-gui, \-\-stop\-gui
Open the local HTML Soft Signal Stop button in a browser. No network.
.TP
.B \-\-guide, \-g
Open the original consent-first guide.
.TP
.B \-\-map, \-\-ritual
First ritual: the map, not the mirror.
.TP
.B \-\-stop, \-\-soft\-signal
Practice firing Soft Signal.
.TP
.B \-\-morning
Morning Cuddle Protocol.
.TP
.B \-\-spoon
Spooning Protocol.
.TP
.B \-\-hold, \-\-not\-ready
I'm Not Ready To Get Up Yet.
.TP
.B \-\-too\-much
I'm Too Much / Fear of Abandonment panic room.
.TP
.B \-\-flood
Flood Protocol — when language is gone.
.TP
.B \-\-aftercare
Aftercare Protocol.
.TP
.B \-\-parallel
Parallel play — closeness without a touch tax.
.TP
.B \-\-touch
Touch Language primer. Never consent.
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Print usage information.
.TP
.B \-\-version, \-V
Print the installed version.
.SH PRIVACY
All guide state exists only in the current process. The program makes no
network calls and creates no files.
.SH NOTES
This tool is not therapy, relationship advice, or a substitute for emergency
help. In immediate danger, contact local emergency services or a trusted person
nearby.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cuddle-tui (1),
.BR cuddle-gui (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Softness as Strength

.SH SHARED LITMO ROOMS
.TP
.B --rooms
List offline room IDs and descriptions.
.TP
.B --room ID
Open a room in the terminal. Includes conflict, interest, morning, parallel,
aftercare, repair, flood, touch, spoon and too-much.
.TP
.B --conflict, --interest, --repair
Shortcuts for conflict practice, want-or-should questions and soft return.
State is held only in memory and cleared on stop. Interest is never consent.
